# Tauri
src-tauri/WixTools/
# Generated by tauri-build on every build from tauri.conf.json + capabilities/.
# Committing them meant committing files this checkout cannot refresh: a macOS
# build regenerates only desktop/macOS, so the linux and windows copies aged in
# place. The `$schema` path in capabilities/*.json resolves after the first
# build, which is the only thing their presence bought.
src-tauri/gen/

